WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.440
Today’s lesson goal: Today’s lesson goal: use lists for ordered items. Use dictionaries for key lookups. Loop collections with foreach.

2
00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:20.986
List and Dictionary: List stores items in sequence. Dictionary maps keys to values. Pick the structure that matches the problem.

3
00:00:21.836 --> 00:00:30.572
Worked example: scores: Worked example: a list of player names and a dictionary of name to score. Foreach name, print the score.

4
00:00:31.422 --> 00:00:43.014
Common mistakes: Common mistakes: using arrays when a List is easier to grow. KeyNotFound when a key is missing. Mutating a collection while foreach runs.

5
00:00:43.864 --> 00:00:55.624
Practice checkpoint: Practice checkpoint: store three items and print them. Look up one value by key. Then continue in the written Module 5 lesson and quiz.
